S group 'Petroleum, Crude & products': crude oil plus imported refined products and petroleum gases such as LNG and LPG classified there.^For crude oil alone (value and tonnes) see the PPAC crude oil imports page."},{"question":"How do I read it?","answer":"Value is price times volume. A rise with flat volumes reflects dearer crude (or a weaker rupee), not more consumption; compare with the crude oil volume series.^Month-to-month swings also reflect cargo timing."},{"question":"Caveats","answer":"The latest month is a quick estimate and is revised later. Values are in US dollars, so the rupee cost differs."}],"related":[],"layer":"added","note":"The latest month is a quick estimate and is revised when final data come in about a month later; earlier months on this page use the revised figure published in the next year's release.","scraped_at":"2026-10-30T07:29:00+00:00"}